I got around this these errors by defining SYSV instead of HPUX in 
unixconf.h (even though the comments say to use HPUX for > 6.5). I was 
compiling under HPUX 8.0 on a 425.  

As for the 'time' errors, just comment out the offending lines in the
makefile.

